      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P004",
        "quote": "In support of the motion, the defendant submitted, inter alia, the deposition testimony of the plaintiff wherein he clearly testified that he slipped and fell due to the presence of salt on the step at issue.",
